# Never commit client or project layers to the portable base repo.
# (Ignore the CONTENTS of clients/, not the folder itself, so the
#  template below can be re-included — Git can't re-include files
#  inside a fully ignored directory.)
clients/*
projects/
*.local-overrides.md
**/governance.md
**/overrides.md

# ...but DO keep the empty template so it can be copied
!clients/_template/
!clients/_template/**
